v><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\" style=\"--text-align:left\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Participar activamente en Discord y en actividades comunitarias.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\" style=\"--text-align:left\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Asistir y organizar eventos locales.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\" style=\"--text-align:left\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Completar módulos educativos y aplicar lo aprendido en proyectos reales.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\" style=\"--text-align:left\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Promover el ecosistema Stellar en Chile y más allá.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"preguntas-frecuentes-fa-qs\" class=\"hynlcx0\" style=\"--text-align:left\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Preguntas Frecuentes (FAQs)</strong></span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\" style=\"--text-align:left\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>¿Necesito experiencia previa?</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">No, el programa está diseñado para principiantes y personas con experiencia en blockchain.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\" style=\"--text-align:left\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>¿Cuánto tiempo debo dedicar?</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El nivel de compromiso depende de ti y de los objetivos que desees alcanzar.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\" style=\"--text-align:left\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>¿Qué apoyo recibiré?</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Acceso a recursos educativos, mentorías y oportunidades para avanzar en tu carrera profesional.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\" style=\"--text-align:left\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>¿Cómo avanzo en los niveles?</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Participando activamente en la comunidad y cumpliendo con los requisitos de cada nivel.</span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"s-parte-del-cambio-con-stellar-chil\" class=\"hynlcx0\" style=\"--text-align:left\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Sé Parte del Cambio con Stellar Chile</strong></span></h2></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-imageBlock _2fealp0\" style=\"--caption-alignment:center\"><div class=\"_2fealp1\"><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 360px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=720,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/8a64a29e-76d2-44b0-bb95-015e1945bdee/image.png?t=1735337445 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 360px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=360,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/8a64a29e-76d2-44b0-bb95-015e1945bdee/image.png?t=1735337445 1x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=860,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/8a64a29e-76d2-44b0-bb95-015e1945bdee/image.png?t=1735337445 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,for